    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44316</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_116_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なぁ、平和なこの時代、
オレらほど戦ってるヤツいねーよな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Say, does anyone fight like us in that
peaceful era?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44440</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_116_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>平和……確かに魔物はいるけど、
基本的にわたしたちの時代は平和なんだよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Peaceful, huh? Yeah, there are monsters,
but that descriptor's definitely apt.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44560</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_116_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だろ？　だったら実戦経験とかゆーヤツも
オレらがトップだぜ、きっと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right? Then in terms of pure skill, we're
the strongest of our time, aren't we?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44676</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_116_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>戦争とかもないわけだから、
そうかな？　うん、そうだね、たぶん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't remember there being any wars,
so...maybe? Probably, I think.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44780</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_116_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>つまりだ！　自分たちの時代なら
オレら人類最強だぜ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So what you're saying is...
We're the greatest warriors in all
of mankind!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44892</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_116_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ええっ！？　そ、そうかな、
もっと強い人もいると思うけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uuuuuh I guess? There's probably some
folks who are still stronger than we are,
though.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44980</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_116_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いねーいねー！
オレ、さいきょう！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hehehe!! I'm the best! The coolest!
The str--</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45052</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_116_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>んっふっふっふ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>*giggles*</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45112</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_004_116_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うっ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Urg...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
